{
  "name": "Stall Order Bot - Order and Sales Report Automation (Telegram + LLM + Postgres)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Stall Order Bot\nOrders are typed freely in Telegram, parsed by an LLM, then validated and priced in a Code node (prices and stock ALWAYS come from the database, never from the LLM) and saved atomically to PostgreSQL.\n\n**Before running:**\n1. Run sql/schema.sql on PostgreSQL\n2. Attach credentials: Telegram, OpenAI, Postgres\n3. Replace `REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CHAT_ID` in the 'Access Check' node\n4. Replace `REPLACE_WITH_OWNER_CHAT_ID` in the 'Owner Chat' node\n5. n8n must be reachable over public HTTPS (Telegram webhook)",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "5fa39dfd-d764-496e-bac8-92cf84b692a2",
      "name": "Notes - General",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -100,
        -140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Order flow\nThe LLM only extracts item names and quantities. Menu matching, prices, totals and stock checks happen in 'Validate & Calculate'. The order, its items and the stock decrement are saved in ONE query (atomic). Duplicate Telegram updates are ignored via UNIQUE telegram_update_id.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "911957e4-22d1-4d48-831b-286b7b0f0452",
      "name": "Notes - Orders",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1060,
        440
      ]
    },
