            {
              "id": "9ea24d61-e936-47e2-9c5b-abe2be75775f",
              "name": "reply_text",
              "value": "Stall Order Bot\n\nSend an order in plain language, for example:\n2 nasi goreng, 1 es teh for Budi\n\nCommands:\n/menu - menu and prices\n/stock - stock levels (low items are flagged)\n/report - today's sales summary\n/help - show this message\n\nA daily report is sent to the owner automatically at 21:00 (Asia/Jakarta).",
              "type": "string"
            }
